        "sha":  "87f69e3e8d83ea329ac388f2a66c761d3eb907d1",
        "description":  "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMedQA Obfuscation Task\n\t\n\nClinical drug-selection vignettes for studying chain-of-thought obfuscation in language models.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nEach sample consists of a patient description paired with a set of possible medications (mapped to placeholders α, β, γ). The task tests whether models can reason about treatment options without mentioning the actual medication names in their chain of thought.\nQuestions are sourced from MedQA-USMLE, filtered for \"best-treatment\"… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/felix-tudose/medqa-obfuscation-task.",
